  "body": "Hi,\n\nOn a Mac, keyboard shortcuts usually use the Command key (Cmd+A, Cmd+Z, etc.); in Art, those same shortcuts use the Control key.\n\nAlso, to switch between photos in the editor, you have to use the F3 and F4 keys (Fn+F3 and Fn+F4 on Mac); it would be a bit simpler and more intuitive to be able to use the left and right arrow keys.\n\nHence my request: would it be possible to have an option in the settings that allows users to customize certain shortcuts themselves? Or is there a file that can be edited to do this?\n\n(Thx)",
